As the maintainer of Twin Cities Linux Users Group (TCLUG) ftp server 
(ftp.mn-linux.org), I'd like to thank the lvm developers for some excellent
software.

We recently upgrade the ftp server to 1.2Tb of disk. We used lvm to create a
volume group consisting of 2 RAID5 arrays. Installation went smooth as glass,
performance is excellent, and the TCLUG members are happy.

Thanks again.


